14px; line-height: 1.6;\">\r\n        We look forward to being part of your most cherished celebration and delivering an event that is both unique and unforgettable.\r\n    </p>','\r\n            <ul style=\"margin: 0 0 0 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">\r\n                <li>42 spacious rooms and luxury suites with modern amenities</li>\r\n                <li>Open-air lawns for Mehendi, Haldi, and Sangeet ceremonies</li>\r\n                <li>Indoor banquet hall ideal for formal functions or receptions</li>\r\n                <li>Scenic forest backdrops for couple photoshoots</li>\r\n                <li>Custom floral dÃ©cor, mandap setups &amp; lighting themes</li>\r\n                <li>Dedicated bridal preparation suite &amp; guest hospitality desk</li>\r\n                <li>Live food counters, customizable veg/non-veg menus</li>\r\n                <li>Bonfire arrangements, wildlife safaris &amp; local experiences</li>\r\n            </ul>','<!-- Additional Testimonial -->\r\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 30px; font-style: italic; border-left: 4px solid #ccc; padding-left: 15px; color: #555;\">\r\n        â€œThe tranquil forest vibe added such uniqueness to our wedding. Our guests still talk about it!â€<br/>\r\n        <strong>â€“ Mr. Tiwari and Family, Delhi NCR</strong>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 30px; font-style: italic; border-left: 4px solid #ccc; padding-left: 15px; color: #555;\">\r\n        â€œEvery detail was handled with care â€” from the decor to the food. The resort staff made us feel like royalty and our families were truly impressed.â€<br/>\r\n        <strong>â€“  From a Recent Wedding Party,  Delhi NCR</strong>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 30px; font-style: italic; border-left: 4px solid #ccc; padding-left: 15px; color: #555;\">\r\n        \"Organizing a destination wedding at Ashokaâ€™s Tiger Trail Resort was an absolute delight. The resort team was proactive, professional, and handled every request with efficiency and grace. Our clients were extremely happy, and the event went off without a hitch. Itâ€™s rare to find a venue that combines natural beauty with such high standards of service.\"<br/>\r\n        <strong>â€“  Mr. Gopi, Corbett</strong>\r\n    </div>','<li>Rates are subject to availability and change until confirmed.</li>\r\n        <li>Booking is confirmed only upon receiving advance payment.</li>\r\n        <li>Event decor and customizations are chargeable based on requirements.</li>\r\n        <li>Final guest count must be confirmed at least 10 days prior to the event.</li>\r\n        <li>Outdoor events are subject to weather; backup arrangements may be made if required.</li>\r\n        <li>Liquor services require valid permits, to be arranged separately.</li>\r\n        <li>External vendors are subject to resort approval.</li>\r\n        <li>Check-in and check-out times are as per resort policy.</li>\r\n        <li>The resort is not responsible for any personal loss or damage during the event.</li>','2026-01-14 11:56:38','2026-03-13 15:43:01');
